120	//     `cleanupComposeProject` call.
121	//   - Every volume present on the daemon BEFORE this test ran is
122	//     captured as a baseline and asserted to still exist afterward.
123	//   - Partial setup (e.g. the bystander project never actually started)
124	//     is handled safely: cleanup only acts on resources the daemon
